  "details": "UDONSDK-2020.01.14.10.47_Public\nVRCSDK3-2020.01.14.10.40\nDescription: See title.\nConsole warning: \"Failed to insert item. Menu item insert limit is reached. Name: Type_CollectionsGenericIListReflectionCustomAttributeData, Command: 1004\"\nExample:\n1. Add any type node. My example uses the Vector3 type\n2. Open the drop down for the type node.\n3. Click  outside to cancel the selection, or alternatively change to another type. \n4. By just opening the type drop down you can now no longer use any unity menu items. right click anywhere to see menu items broken.",
